1
00:00:05,226 --> 00:00:07,511
[Ji-sung Kang]

2
00:00:15,598 --> 00:00:19,894
I guess I'm really
on my own now.

3
00:00:20,741 --> 00:00:22,017
[Seung-hyun Park]

4
00:00:27,769 --> 00:00:30,772
Still no word from Seung-hyun?

5
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:33,926
I've tried calling
but no answer.

6
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:36,545
Did something happen?

7
00:00:38,586 --> 00:00:41,589
I'll go check on him.

8
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:44,044
Alright.

9
00:00:47,714 --> 00:00:50,717
Seung-hyun, it's me.

10
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:53,845
You're in there, right?

11
00:00:54,054 --> 00:00:55,430
I need to talk to you.

12
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:57,891
Open up.

13
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:01,227
Please leave.

14
00:01:01,228 --> 00:01:04,523
Seung‑hyun
is something wrong?

15
00:01:04,787 --> 00:01:07,790
Nothing.

16
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:12,739
I just want to be alone.

17
00:01:13,237 --> 00:01:15,573
Seung-hyun, something's wrong.

18
00:01:15,574 --> 00:01:18,577
Let me in.

19
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:23,124
Just go.

20
00:01:23,124 --> 00:01:27,420
Please, just leave me alone!
